<programme start="20261030032300 +0000" stop="20261030035300 +0000" channel="Yu-Gi-Oh"><title lang="es">Yu-Gi-Oh! GX</title><sub-title lang="es">Conquistar el pasado, Parte 2</sub-title><desc lang="es">Bajo la apariencia de Jesse, Yubel se enfrenta a Zane en un enfrentamiento que acaba teniendo consecuencias de infarto.</desc><credits><actor>Matthew Charles</actor><actor>Wayne Grayson</actor><actor>Tony Salerno</actor><actor>Kanako Irie</actor><actor>Sean Schemmel</actor></credits><date>20250602</date><category lang="es">Anime</category><category lang="es">Anime Series</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">2.42.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S03E43</episode-num><rating><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://images.pluto.tv/series/687e46784f8d4a99177053ce/tile_1769630761716.jpg?fill=blur&amp;fit=fill&amp;fm=jpg&amp;h=660&amp;q=75&amp;w=660"/></programme>
<programme start="20261030035300 +0000" stop="20261030042300 +0000" channel="Yu-Gi-Oh"><title lang="es">Yu-Gi-Oh! GX</title><sub-title lang="es">Conquistar el pasado, Parte 3</sub-title><desc lang="es">A medida que la batalla se acerca a su fin, Zane intenta hacer un último esfuerzo para liberar a Jesse de las garras de Yubel, que controla su mente, antes de que su corazón le obligue a tirar la toalla.</desc><credits><actor>Matthew Charles</actor><actor>Wayne Grayson</actor><actor>Tony Salerno</actor><actor>Kanako Irie</actor><actor>Sean Schemmel</actor></credits><date>20250602</date><category lang="es">Anime</category><category lang="es">Anime Series</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">2.43.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S03E44</episode-num><rating><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://images.pluto.tv/series/687e46784f8d4a99177053ce/tile_1769630761716.jpg?fill=blur&amp;fit=fill&amp;fm=jpg&amp;h=660&amp;q=75&amp;w=660"/></programme>
